  "anySetupA11yReassure": "You can pause or stop at any time. Complete payments, passwords and sign-ins yourself.",
  "anySetupCorrectService": "Choose the app you just installed. For the test app, select “DSH AnyApp 测试 · 手机操控”; for the regular app, select “DSH AnyApp Phone Control”.",
  "anySetupNotificationsTitle": "Notifications · stay on time",
  "anySetupNotificationsHelp": "Get a reminder when your timer ends, even in another app. This only lets AnyApp send notifications; it doesn’t read messages from other apps.",
  "anySetupNotificationsAction": "Allow reminders",
  "anySetupOverlayTitle": "Floating entry · within reach",
  "anySetupOverlayHelp": "While shopping, tap the floating entry to find actions such as price comparison without switching back. It appears above other apps, and you can collapse or hide it any time.",
  "anySetupOverlayAction": "Set up the floating entry",
  "anySetupCameraHelp": "Use the camera to identify an object or record a meal. To use an existing photo, choose it with the system photo picker instead.",
  "anySetupMicHelp": "The microphone lets you speak instead of type. You can leave it off and keep using text.",
  "anySetupListenerHelp": "To organize new delivery or travel notifications, enable notification access separately and select the apps to include. This is broader than receiving reminders; enable it only if you want that feature.",
  "anySetupEngineTitle": "Phone assistant tools",
  "anySetupEngineHelp": "Enable these tools so your apps can request screen reading, taps and scrolling. System accessibility is a separate switch, and you choose which apps may use it.",
  "anySetupBatteryHelp": "If reminders arrive late after the screen turns off, reduce background restrictions for this app. Settings vary by phone, and this can’t guarantee uninterrupted operation.",
  "anySetupAutostartHelp": "Check autostart if you want configured reminders after restarting your phone. Some phones don’t offer this option. After force-stopping the app, you still need to open it again yourself.",
  "anySetupBackgroundHelp": "If a long task or reminder gets interrupted, check battery and background settings. Start with the defaults and adjust only if needed.",
  "anySetupPopupHelp": "Some phones block an app from opening after a task. You can allow background opening, or keep the default and return through a notification.",
  "anySetupExactHelp": "Allow Alarms & reminders to help timers fire closer to their scheduled time. Your phone may ask you to confirm this in Settings.",
  "anySetupExactAction": "Set up timely reminders",
  "anySetupCalendarHelp": "Allow calendar access when you want to read or add events. Countdowns and simple lists don’t need it.",
  "anySetupLocationHelp": "Current location helps find nearby places or plan a departure. One-time or while-in-use access is usually enough.",
  "anySetupFilesHelp": "Choose the files you want to import or where to save an export. Ordinary importing doesn’t need access to all files.",
  "anySetupFilesActionHelp": "Return to the app’s Import or Export action, then choose files in the system picker. No advance permission is needed here.",
  "anySetupCaptureHelp": "Start a screenshot or screen share when you want the assistant to see a page. Your phone may ask for confirmation each time, and protected screens may block capture.",
  "anySetupEntriesHelp": "Put a favorite app or action on your home screen. Or share a link or photo to AnyApp from another app.",
  "anySetupSpeechHelp": "Use your phone’s installed speech services to read aloud or dictate. Text remains available if a service isn’t supported.",
